--->

<Layout {seo}>
		<TextSection>
			<h2>Polyoxometalates to crystallize microgram amounts of radioactive material at Lawrence Livermore National Lab</h2>
The original goal of the project was to see if POMs can be a viable system to crystallize radioactive materials in small quantities. Why small quantities and why POMs? 1) to minimize hazards and minimize precious material, 2) POMs are extremely heavy and resistant. POMs can make crystal systems where less than 10% is the radioactive material. If a crystal is 1 microgram, then  it contains less than 100 nanograms of our radioactive material. The project has evolved into so much more...			
</TextSection>
<TextSection>

          <p>
            <strong>Various representation of [Cm(W5O18)2]9-</strong><br/>
          <picture>
            <img
              src="/Research.github.io/assets/images/bitmap.webp"
              alt="CmW5"
              loading="lazy"
              decoding="async"
            />
          </picture>
</TextSection>

<TextSection>
<h2>Various types of POMs used for Am, Cm, and Cf</h2>

</TextSection>

	<CtaCardSection
    background="var(--theme-surface-1); --container-max-width-narrow: var(--container-max-width)"
    color="var(--theme-on-surface-1)"
  >


    <div class="cards">
      {favorites.map((f) => (
        <article class="card">
          <header class="head">
            <h3 class="title"><a href={f.href}>{f.title}</a></h3>
            <p class="blurb">{f.blurb}</p>
          </header>

          <!-- exactly 3 images per structure -->
          <div class="thumbs">
            {f.images.slice(0, 1).map((src, i) => (
              <a class="thumb" href={src} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
                <img src={src} alt={`${f.title} — image ${i + 1}`} loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
              </a>
            ))}
          </div>

                  </article>
      ))}
    </div>
  </CtaCardSection>
<TextSection>
<h2>Project evolved into looking at correlations between... </h2>
</TextSection>
<ThreeColumnTextSection>

		<div slot="column-1-body">
			<h3>Composition</h3>
			<p>
				Over 7 POMs are avaliable to study, with over 20 metal cations.
			</p>
		</div>
		<div slot="column-2-body">
			<h3>Structure</h3>
			<p>
				Although complexes are generally the same, slight differences exist.
			</p>
		</div>
		<div slot="column-3-body">
			<h3>Properties</h3>
			<p>
				Compositional and structural differences then compound leading to vastly different physio-chemical properties.
			</p>
		</div>
	</ThreeColumnTextSection>
<TextSection>

          <p>
            <strong>Luminescence of [Cm(W5O18)2]9-</strong><br/>
          <picture>
            <img
              src="/Research.github.io/assets/images/bitmap-2.webp"
              alt="CmW5"
              loading="lazy"
              decoding="async"
            />
          </picture>
</TextSection>

<TextSection>
<h3>Milestones!</h3>
<ul>
        <li>15 publications!</li>
        <li>185 crystals strcutures</li>
        <li>30 structures with Am, Cm, or Cf</li>
        <li>6 journal covers</li>

</ul>
</TextSection>
<TextSection>
	<h2>Built upon the foundational work from Oregon State University</h2>
My thesis work involved looking at uranium, thorium, and cerium oxide formation in the presence of competeing counterions. The work in handling radioactive material and the extensive crystallography lead to the work done at Lawrence Livermore National Lab.
			      
</TextSection>


	</Layout>

<style>
/* responsive grid of 6 cards */
.cards {
  display: grid;
  gap: 1rem;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
  margin-top: 1rem;
}
@media (max-width: 1100px) { .cards { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); } }
@media (max-width: 680px)  { .cards { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }

/* individual card styling (with safe fallbacks) */
.card {
  border: 1px solid color-mix(in oklab, currentColor 10%, transparent);
  border-radius: var(--theme-shape-radius, 14px);
  background: var(--theme-surface-1, #fff);
  padding: 1rem;
  text-align: left;
  box-shadow: 0 1px 12px color-mix(in oklab, black 6%, transparent);
}
.head { margin-bottom: .5rem; }
.title { margin: 0 0 .25rem; font-size: 1.05rem; line-height: 1.2; }
.title a { text-decoration: none; }
.blurb { margin: 0; opacity: .85; }


@media (max-width: 540px) { .thumbs { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr 1fr; } }

.thumb { display: block; border-radius: 10px; overflow: hidden ; }
.thumb img {
  width: 100%; height: auto;
  aspect-ratio: 4 / 3;
  object-fit: contain;
  display: block;
}

.foot { margin-top: .5rem; }
.link { text-decoration: none; font-weight: 600; }
</style>

